Dua Dengi Tumhe Zahra Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
hai Lene Ko Yaha Pursa Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
01. Saliqa Majlis E Shah Ka<br>
ata E Zainab E Kubra<br>
hai Momin Ke Liye Tohfa Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
02. Kabhi Bhulo Na Is Gham Ko<br>
uthao Haath Maatam Ko<br>
karam Abbas Ka Hoga Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
03.alam Yu Hee Uthao Tum<br>
yuhi Aansu Bahaao Tum<br>
bahaao Tum Lahu Apna Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
04.kiya Wo Zulm Aada Ne<br>
kate Abbas Ke Shaane<br>
wo Saqqa E Sakina Tha Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
05. Wo Farwa Ka Dulara Tha<br>
badan Tukde Hua Jiska<br>
ho Matam Uski Shaadi Ka Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
06. Tha Laila Ka Jawaan Beta<br>
wo Hamshakle Payambar Tha<br>
laga Tha Qalb Me Naiza Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
07.wo Kamsin Tashnalab Asghar<br>
laga Tha Teer Gardan Par<br>
hai Jhula Khali Ab Uska Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
08. Gharane Par Muhammad Ke<br>
huwe Haaye Sitam Kaise<br>
luta Ek Din Me Ghar Saara Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
09. Badi Nemat Mili Hamko<br>
badi Izzat Mili Hamko<br>
ye Sab Ehsaan Hai Uska Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka<br>
<br>
10. Rasheed Ab Waaris E Gham Ko<br>
adab Se Pesh E Pursa Ho<br>
yahi Hai Apna Nazrana Karo Matam Shaheedo Ka